questions.stem:
Four volunteers each take a different duty. Their options are:

Anya: welcome or raffle;
Bran: raffle, welcome or tickets;
Cora: tickets or packs;
Deni: packs or raffle.

If Cora takes tickets, Anya must take welcome and Deni must take packs. Which assignment could work?

A committee must pick two screenings in different venues and in different languages, at least one before 18:00. Its choices are:

Kite (Hall, Polish, 17:00);
Ink (Loft, Arabic, 17:30);
Glass (Hall, Arabic, 19:00);
Tide (Loft, Hindi, 18:15);
Map (Yard, Arabic, 20:00);
Thread (Yard, Polish, 19:30).

Which screening could not be picked?

Four assistants are available. Each task takes one assistant, and no one can work on two tasks at once. A task can start only when its prerequisites are finished:

Print: 6 minutes, no prerequisite;
Fold: 4 minutes, after Print;
Trim: 3 minutes, after Print;
Pack: 8 minutes, no prerequisite;
Mail: 5 minutes, after both Trim and Fold.

What is the earliest Mail can finish, measured from when the assistants become available?
